    "m2_prompt_trader_proposal_original": "**Action**: Hold\n\n**Reasoning**: The evidence is genuinely balanced, supporting a Hold stance. The bull case rests on strong fundamentals ($110.5B operating cash flow, 2B-device installed base, high-margin Services growth) and an intact long-term trend (price above 200 SMA at $180.01, golden cross structure intact). However, the short-term technical picture is deteriorating: MACD histogram expanding negatively for three sessions (-0.14 \u2192 -0.30 \u2192 -0.44), price below the 10 EMA, 50 SMA, and Bollinger middle band, and the 200 SMA was pierced intraday. Q1 FY2024 data is unavailable in this historical run, so the growth acceleration thesis is unverifiable. With price at $183.61 only ~2% above the 200 SMA and below multiple resistance levels, initiating new longs lacks confirmation, while selling a company with this cash-generation quality would overreact to short-term noise. Maintain neutral weight until either a reclaim of the 10 EMA (~$186.26) and 50 SMA (~$188.35) on a closing basis, or a genuine reversal pattern at the 200 SMA (~$180.01) / Bollinger lower band (~$177.37) provides a confirmed entry trigger.\n\n**Stop Loss**: 177.0\n\n**Position Sizing**: Neutral/benchmark weight. Do not overweight until technical confirmation arrives.\n\nFINAL TRANSACTION PROPOSAL: **HOLD**",
